/08/kinross-gold-corporation-kgc-q3-2018-earnings-conf.aspx"},{"c":"KGC 2018 Q3","e":"kgc","d":"2018-11-08","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Tanya Jakusconek","x":"And then just, Tony, on the capital expenditures, I mean, you reiterated guidance there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/08/kinross-gold-corporation-kgc-q3-2018-earnings-conf.aspx"},{"c":"KGC 2019 Q3","e":"kgc","d":"2019-11-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Paul Rollinson","x":"I think the point is we're reiterating guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/07/kinross-gold-kgc-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"KGC 2019 Q4","e":"kgc","d":"2020-02-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Rollinson","x":"As part of our portfolio optimization, we sold our Lundin Gold shares and our royalty portfolio delivering additional cash to the balance sheet, and we realized approximately $30 million in annual cost savings in overhead and other operational efficiencies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/14/kinross-gold-kgc-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"KGC 2020 Q1","e":"kgc","d":"2020-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Tomory","x":"Importantly, cash cost of Paracatu were lower than Q4 as a result of our continued cost reduction strategy, improved productivity, supported by favorable currency.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/kinross-gold-kgc-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"KGC 2020 Q1","e":"kgc","d":"2020-05-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Paul Rollinson","x":"Although we withdrew our 2020 guidance in recognition of the uncertain operating environment, we will continue to work toward the original targets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/kinross-gold-kgc-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"KGC 2020 Q4","e":"kgc","d":"2021-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Tomory","x":"Finally, at Chirano, I'm proud of the hard work that the team did to extend mine life by three years, a culmination of a refined focus on drilling, great exploration, cost cutting, productivity, engineering, tailings facility expansion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/kinross-gold-kgc-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KGC 2020 Q4","e":"kgc","d":"2021-02-11","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Paul Rollinson","x":"Last night, we reaffirmed our guidance of production rising approximately 20% over the next three years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/kinross-gold-kgc-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KGC 2021 Q1","e":"kgc","d":"2021-05-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Rollinson","x":"We're constantly using continuous improvement initiatives to drive efficiency and cost savings to offset inflation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/12/kinross-gold-kgc-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KGC 2021 Q2","e":"kgc","d":"2021-07-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Andrea Freeborough","x":"Starting with cost of sales, we've increased our 2021 guidance from $790 to $830 per ounce.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/kinross-gold-kgc-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KGC 2021 Q2","e":"kgc","d":"2021-07-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Andrea Freeborough","x":"We have also increased guidance for all-in sustaining costs from $1,025 to $1,110 per ounce.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/kinross-gold-kgc-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KGC 2021 Q3","e":"kgc","d":"2021-11-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul Tomory","x":"In some commodities, we continue to see price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/12/kinross-gold-kgc-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KGC 2021 Q4","e":"kgc","d":"2022-02-17","l"